<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A TURN, TURN-A</i>

00:00:09.360 --> 00:00:12.240
<b><i>#ENCODERGASM PRESENTS</i></b>

00:00:12.240 --> 00:00:20.240
<i>toki ga mirai ni susumu to dare ga kimeta no da?</i>

00:00:12.240 --> 00:00:20.240
<b>Who decided that time should move forward towards the future?</b>

00:00:20.290 --> 00:00:26.830
<i>rakuin o kesu inochi ga rekishi o kakinaosu</i>

00:00:20.290 --> 00:00:26.830
<b>The lives that will erase these brands will rewrite history</b>

00:00:28.250 --> 00:00:34.840
<i>utsukushii tsurugi wa hito to hito tsunagete</i>

00:00:28.250 --> 00:00:34.840
<b>People are connected by beautiful, double-edged swords</b>

00:00:35.720 --> 00:00:44.770
<i>meguri kuru setsuna sa kanashimi wo aratte</i>

00:00:35.720 --> 00:00:44.770
<b>Our coming anticipation will wash away our sadness</b>

00:00:45.810 --> 00:00:53.780
<i>anata to no aida ni inochi aru katachi wo</i>

00:00:45.810 --> 00:00:53.780
<b>With you, between us, life is formed</b>

00:00:53.780 --> 00:01:05.120
<i>Kono hoshi ni sasageru ai to iu shirushi de</i>

00:00:53.780 --> 00:01:05.120
<b>With the proof called "love" that we offer to this planet</b>

00:01:05.710 --> 00:01:06.080
<i>TURN</i>

00:01:06.080 --> 00:01:06.580
<i>TURN-A</i>

00:01:06.580 --> 00:01:07.580
<i>TURN-A TURN,</i>

00:01:07.580 --> 00:01:08.080
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN</i>

00:01:08.080 --> 00:01:08.500
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A</i>

00:01:08.500 --> 00:01:09.500
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A TURN,</i>

00:01:09.500 --> 00:01:10.210
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A TURN, TURN</i>

00:01:10.210 --> 00:01:13.590
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A TURN, TURN-A</i>

00:01:13.710 --> 00:01:14.090
<i>TURN</i>

00:01:14.090 --> 00:01:14.590
<i>TURN-A</i>

00:01:14.590 --> 00:01:15.590
<i>TURN-A TURN,</i>

00:01:15.590 --> 00:01:16.090
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN</i>

00:01:16.090 --> 00:01:16.510
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A</i>

00:01:16.510 --> 00:01:17.510
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A TURN,</i>

00:01:17.510 --> 00:01:18.180
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A TURN, TURN</i>

00:01:18.180 --> 00:01:20.680
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A TURN, TURN-A</i>

00:01:24.020 --> 00:01:26.730
<i>At the request of Dianna Counter's Lieutenant Zenoa...</i>

00:01:26.730 --> 00:01:29.840
<i>I have been entrusted with the two nuclear bombs.</i>

00:01:31.320 --> 00:01:35.320
<i>They were found in Lost Mountain, and we're uncertain if they're still usable.</i>

00:01:36.610 --> 00:01:43.830
<i>Even so, I am now responsible for properly disposing of them.</i>

00:01:49.250 --> 00:01:53.210
<b>The Two Named Soriel</b>

00:02:12.820 --> 00:02:15.900
Are you concerned for your sister, Sochie Heim?

00:02:15.900 --> 00:02:17.530
That's correct.

00:02:17.530 --> 00:02:22.120
Didn't Lieutenant Harry mention that the one who was running from the Soleil was Dianna?

00:02:22.910 --> 00:02:23.910
Yes.

00:02:24.030 --> 00:02:27.910
Then, there's no reason for us to assume Kihel would openly provoke Dianna Counter.

00:02:27.910 --> 00:02:30.210
Do you think so?

00:02:30.210 --> 00:02:31.630
That's correct.

00:02:31.630 --> 00:02:35.000
Fran will also be watching over Loran closely, so don't worry about it.

00:02:35.000 --> 00:02:36.630
I understand.

00:02:36.630 --> 00:02:39.220
However, Joseph couldn't possibly understand...

00:02:40.220 --> 00:02:41.510
The nature of that horrid explosion...

00:02:42.300 --> 00:02:45.720
After all that, when I think about my sister being out there all alone, I can't help but worry.

00:02:45.720 --> 00:02:47.600
I'm sorry, but I'm going!

00:02:52.610 --> 00:02:56.110
Miss Sochie has been rather quiet as of late.

00:02:56.110 --> 00:02:58.740
Could it have something to do with Loran's mission?

00:03:02.410 --> 00:03:04.030
The answer will be the same no matter how many times you ask me!

00:03:04.030 --> 00:03:07.040
My name is Kihel Heim, and I know nothing more.

00:03:07.040 --> 00:03:11.330
You'd be mistaken if you assume we value your life, so I suggest you cooperate.

00:03:11.330 --> 00:03:14.000
If you wish to kill me, then go ahead.

00:03:14.000 --> 00:03:16.630
This will only make your actions all the more foolish.

00:03:16.630 --> 00:03:17.920
What's that?

00:03:17.920 --> 00:03:21.300
You wish to kill Dianna's double...

00:03:21.300 --> 00:03:25.300
...and yet meanwhile, the real Dianna is not even aboard the Soleil.

00:03:25.640 --> 00:03:29.600
Does a man like that have the strength needed to build his own kingdom?

00:03:31.440 --> 00:03:35.110
Well, in regards to the nuclear bombs that Zenoa had before he died...

00:03:35.110 --> 00:03:37.610
That is a matter that should be discussed at a later time.

00:03:37.610 --> 00:03:40.240
Retrieve the woman that Harry has taken away.

00:03:40.240 --> 00:03:41.530
You mean Queen Dianna?

00:03:41.530 --> 00:03:42.740
She's just a woman!

00:03:42.740 --> 00:03:44.030
Y- Yes!

00:03:44.030 --> 00:03:47.910
These people will listen to me after I have built a new kingdom.

00:03:47.910 --> 00:03:50.620
And once that's complete, you can become that kingdom's Queen!

00:03:50.620 --> 00:03:52.410
Right...

00:03:52.410 --> 00:03:56.210
But first, we need to retrieve that woman!

00:03:58.210 --> 00:03:59.420
I'll do it!

00:04:09.310 --> 00:04:11.230
Okay! Systems all-check!

00:04:11.520 --> 00:04:16.440
Make sure you monitor the oil pressure levels closely. After that, check to make sure that all blocks are air-tight.

00:04:16.440 --> 00:04:19.900
The Militia is to submit and listen closely to the mechanics' orders!

00:04:19.900 --> 00:04:23.030
As far as I can tell, everything works fine so far.

00:04:23.030 --> 00:04:26.620
All hands, please make sure that the system you're responsible is in working order.

00:04:27.200 --> 00:04:29.830
I'm going down below now. And you, Sir Guin?

00:04:29.830 --> 00:04:31.330
Allow me the use of your microphone.

00:04:31.330 --> 00:04:34.040
I wish to extend my personal thanks to all the mechanics.

00:04:34.040 --> 00:04:35.040
Please do.

00:04:35.040 --> 00:04:36.330
Thank you.

00:04:36.630 --> 00:04:39.210
This is Guin Rhineford.

00:04:39.210 --> 00:04:42.210
Due to the technological assistance we've received from the Moonrace's people...

00:04:42.210 --> 00:04:45.720
We have been given this opportunity to sail the skies.

00:04:45.720 --> 00:04:48.800
It is my hope that you will use your technological ability not only for the Willgem...

00:04:48.800 --> 00:04:50.930
But to improve the lives of everyone who is living on the earth.

00:04:50.930 --> 00:04:54.600
Those abilities could be used to help rebuild this earth...

00:04:54.600 --> 00:04:58.110
...to allow everyone, including the Moonrace, to have a more comfortable existence.

00:04:58.110 --> 00:05:01.610
On behalf of the Militia, I sincerely offer you my gratitude.

00:05:05.240 --> 00:05:08.620
You're going to eventually become the new president of Ameria, won't you?

00:05:08.620 --> 00:05:09.910
Perhaps...

00:05:09.910 --> 00:05:12.830
There's no doubt in my mind.

00:05:15.710 --> 00:05:16.920
This is really something!

00:05:16.920 --> 00:05:19.130
I don't think it was always this easy to use...

00:05:19.130 --> 00:05:21.840
I still don't really understand anything about this.

00:05:21.840 --> 00:05:23.840
Still, something smells fishy.

00:05:23.840 --> 00:05:25.220
You think so?

00:05:25.220 --> 00:05:28.010
Something feels out of place here.

00:05:28.010 --> 00:05:29.220
Out of place?

00:05:29.220 --> 00:05:34.930
That's right. We'll now be traveling to Maniupich thanks to the Moonrace technicians' suggestion.

00:05:35.230 --> 00:05:39.730
Well, they say that some of them used to be in the Dianna Counter's supply units.

00:05:39.730 --> 00:05:42.400
Do you believe people like them would help us?

00:05:42.400 --> 00:05:44.320
I don't believe so myself... but...

00:05:44.320 --> 00:05:48.240
Without their assistance, we never would've been able to use a ship like this to reach space.

00:05:48.240 --> 00:05:52.030
Even if they take us prisoner, it might be worth it. After all, It gave us a chance to see space.

00:05:52.030 --> 00:05:56.710
In the end, Chief Horace and the noble heir are two of a kind. They're neither enemies nor allies.

00:06:10.510 --> 00:06:12.140
He's got good instincts.

00:06:23.730 --> 00:06:24.900
Let's see...

00:06:27.900 --> 00:06:29.530
There's a bike sized object there.

00:06:38.710 --> 00:06:39.710
Is something wrong?

00:06:41.830 --> 00:06:43.920
Why would you scare me like that?

00:06:43.920 --> 00:06:46.340
You're not terribly perceptive, Fran.

00:06:54.810 --> 00:06:57.020
Well well, It was there all along.

00:06:57.020 --> 00:06:58.730
It's a good hiding place.

00:06:58.730 --> 00:07:00.730
Seems to be shining a bit too brightly though, isn't it?

00:07:00.730 --> 00:07:02.440
That's just for now.

00:07:04.820 --> 00:07:05.900
What's wrong?

00:07:05.900 --> 00:07:07.900
What are those!?

00:07:08.400 --> 00:07:11.320
Those are only a few small leeches.

00:07:11.320 --> 00:07:13.320
They only suck a small amount of your blood.

00:07:13.320 --> 00:07:14.910
Blood?

00:07:17.620 --> 00:07:18.830
No way!

00:07:19.330 --> 00:07:21.330
Well, then why don't you just climb aboard the White Doll?

00:07:21.330 --> 00:07:23.130
If you stand around here, more of them will start falling on you.

00:07:29.920 --> 00:07:31.300
You little...!

00:07:31.300 --> 00:07:33.720
- Get out of there!
- That's dangerous!

00:07:37.220 --> 00:07:41.100
So, Lady Sochie is heading south to catch up to the Willgem?

00:07:41.100 --> 00:07:43.520
That's correct. She's with Joseph as well.

00:07:43.520 --> 00:07:45.110
I'm glad to hear it.

00:07:45.110 --> 00:07:47.610
Although, Mr. Joseph can be a bit frightening at times.

00:07:47.610 --> 00:07:50.320
Perhaps, but he can also be a very gentle man.

00:07:50.320 --> 00:07:53.410
Still, I think we're better off keeping this nuclear bomb issue to ourselves.

00:07:54.620 --> 00:07:59.700
No matter where we go, I don't believe there's any truly safe place on earth for me to hide these nuclear bombs.

00:07:59.700 --> 00:08:01.830
You've stored them in this unit's chest?

00:08:01.830 --> 00:08:02.920
That's right.

00:08:02.920 --> 00:08:06.920
So this guy's got a burning nuclear fire inside its chest now, you say?

00:08:07.000 --> 00:08:10.710
That's exactly right. A fire that can burn away mankind.

00:08:15.800 --> 00:08:18.220
That's it, I've got it!

00:08:18.220 --> 00:08:20.310
The perfect place to dispose of them!

00:08:20.310 --> 00:08:21.520
The sky?

00:08:21.520 --> 00:08:24.810
If Colonel Michael and the rest of them are heading for Maniupich...

00:08:24.810 --> 00:08:27.110
...The Willgem will be heading up into space!

00:08:27.110 --> 00:08:29.730
That means, if I were to board the Willgem...

00:08:29.730 --> 00:08:30.900
I get it!

00:08:30.900 --> 00:08:33.030
We'll bring them in space and throw them away!

00:08:40.830 --> 00:08:43.210
That's the Willgem, isn't it?

00:09:01.720 --> 00:09:03.730
Is that a metal airship?

00:09:03.730 --> 00:09:07.730
It must be a new model if the navy is giving them a welcome signal.

00:09:27.210 --> 00:09:29.000
Lieutenant, can you hear me?

00:09:29.000 --> 00:09:30.000
Yes.

00:09:30.000 --> 00:09:32.000
They have stopped at the Hughes Harbor.

00:09:32.000 --> 00:09:37.010
It appears that the Willgem will proceed to Maniupich in order to reach the Zacktraeger.

00:09:37.010 --> 00:09:38.220
Right.

00:09:38.220 --> 00:09:41.010
It seems likely that he intends to establish direct negotiations with Agrippa.

00:09:41.010 --> 00:09:45.020
That ambitious man, Guin Rhineford, is undoubtedly on that ship with them.

00:09:45.310 --> 00:09:47.020
Ambitious, you say?

00:09:47.020 --> 00:09:50.520
If he's able do whatever he pleases, this war will only continue to expand.

00:09:50.520 --> 00:09:51.940
Will we be able to dissuade him?

00:09:51.940 --> 00:09:53.610
That will become my responsibility.

00:09:57.030 --> 00:10:00.320
Got it? We'll show him just how powerful these Bazookas are!

00:10:00.320 --> 00:10:01.700
Aren't we going to attack?

00:10:01.700 --> 00:10:04.620
Does it appear as though they have the desire to fight?

00:10:04.620 --> 00:10:06.710
Someone is over there with that SUMO.

00:10:06.710 --> 00:10:08.920
Well, when you consider that it belongs to Lieutenant Harry...

00:10:08.920 --> 00:10:10.630
Dianna Soriel?

00:10:10.630 --> 00:10:13.340
Even when using the opera glasses, I can't tell.

00:10:13.340 --> 00:10:16.510
At any rate, I can't understand what Dianna Soriel would be doing here.

00:10:31.940 --> 00:10:36.740
I am Dianna Soriel. I would like to speak directly with your master, Guin Rhineford.

00:10:36.740 --> 00:10:43.030
Judging from your attire, and the fact that the Dianna Counter leader actually came here alone, I'm having a hard time believing you.

00:10:43.030 --> 00:10:47.040
There's only one person who Lieutenant Harry would ever be escorting, and that's Dianna.

00:10:47.200 --> 00:10:50.330
Colonel Michael, please take me to the ship.

00:10:50.330 --> 00:10:54.000
Very well then, Your Highness, Dianna Soriel.

00:10:55.920 --> 00:10:57.340
What is it?

00:10:57.340 --> 00:11:01.300
- Please allow me to speak with Ambassador Miran.
- I can't do that.

00:11:01.300 --> 00:11:03.010
Then how about Commander Phil?

00:11:03.010 --> 00:11:05.720
I have been given orders to only relay messages to you.

00:11:11.520 --> 00:11:17.030
Now, I absolutely must return to the moon in order to find out what Agrippa's true intentions are!

00:11:27.700 --> 00:11:31.040
Say, do you think this place would be suitable enough for hiding the Nuclear weapons?

00:11:31.040 --> 00:11:34.420
Even if I hid them in the middle of a desert, they would still be on earth.

00:11:34.420 --> 00:11:35.920
I guess so.

00:11:35.920 --> 00:11:39.130
Joseph mentioned that the SUMO was also heading south...

00:11:39.630 --> 00:11:40.800
Sit down.

00:11:46.430 --> 00:11:48.430
Have the warships in the harbor support us!

00:11:48.430 --> 00:11:50.430
Chief Horace is currently getting us cleared for departure.

00:11:50.430 --> 00:11:52.020
What is it, Sir Guin?

00:11:52.020 --> 00:11:55.020
Miss Lily, get in the ship. I'll handle the negotiations.

00:11:56.020 --> 00:11:58.900
Sir Guin's about to leave! Can we send out the Armadillo?

00:11:58.900 --> 00:12:00.110
No problem!

00:12:00.110 --> 00:12:01.400
That's a steep drop...

00:12:01.400 --> 00:12:03.240
Are there any problems?

00:12:07.620 --> 00:12:09.200
Get me though to Chief Horace!

00:12:09.200 --> 00:12:10.200
I'm contacting him now.

00:12:10.200 --> 00:12:11.330
And take me to where the Colonel is.

00:12:11.330 --> 00:12:12.330
Yes Sir!

00:12:17.840 --> 00:12:20.130
Can't you be a bit more gentle with this thing?

00:12:20.130 --> 00:12:22.220
That's about as gentle as I can get a jump to be for my first time.

00:12:22.220 --> 00:12:23.800
It's your first time?

00:12:23.800 --> 00:12:27.640
Chief Horace, Ensure that Luzianna's Navy is willing to assist us.

00:12:27.640 --> 00:12:31.100
Yes. I doubt they can do it here... but over to the east...

00:12:31.100 --> 00:12:33.440
What was the name of the ship?

00:12:33.440 --> 00:12:38.730
- It's the Champs Elysies.
- Umm...The Chans Eryies says they'll give you support.

00:12:52.080 --> 00:12:56.880
Guin Rhineford finds it hard to believe that Dianna would end up traveling here in person to meet with us.

00:12:56.880 --> 00:13:01.670
I see. Then do you think those aboard the Willgem won't be willing to negotiate with her?

00:13:02.210 --> 00:13:06.800
There must be a reason for Queen Dianna Soriel to have come here in person.

00:13:06.800 --> 00:13:10.390
If you intend to use the gateway to reach the moon, I'm here to persuade you not to do so.

00:13:10.390 --> 00:13:13.890
Any attempt to travel to the moon right now would end up bringing about rather unfortunate consequences.

00:13:13.890 --> 00:13:15.480
Are you saying we'd die?

00:13:15.480 --> 00:13:19.480
Rather, I refer to the deaths of everyone on this planet.

00:13:19.690 --> 00:13:25.280
I plead with you to stop traveling a path that leads to unseen disaster, Sir Guin.

00:13:25.280 --> 00:13:28.110
What makes you so certain?

00:13:28.110 --> 00:13:34.200
I seek to stop people at your barbaric level from reaching that which the pinnacle of mankind's wisdom built.

00:13:34.200 --> 00:13:37.080
You may as well have told us you don't want to give a fool a knife.

00:13:37.080 --> 00:13:40.380
However, your so called wise moonrace loves to fight!

00:13:40.380 --> 00:13:42.210
What makes you so superior?

00:13:55.180 --> 00:13:58.310
Lieutenant Harry, return that woman to us!

00:13:59.400 --> 00:14:03.400
Do you expect me to simply hand over Queen Dianna, Lieutenant Poe?

00:14:03.400 --> 00:14:06.400
Wouldn't I be right in saying that you've already betrayed Dianna Soriel?

00:14:06.400 --> 00:14:08.700
Betrayed?

00:14:11.280 --> 00:14:15.290
Lieutenant Harry, Poe must not be allowed to attack the Willgem!

00:14:15.410 --> 00:14:16.710
Understood.

00:14:17.000 --> 00:14:18.920
Protect the Willgem!

00:14:18.920 --> 00:14:19.790
Sir!

00:14:19.790 --> 00:14:22.210
This person, could it really be Queen Dianna?

00:14:22.210 --> 00:14:24.090
- Protect her!
- How rude!

00:14:30.890 --> 00:14:32.680
It's capable of transforming!?

00:14:32.680 --> 00:14:35.680
These must be the ones which were excavated from Lost Mountain.

00:14:35.680 --> 00:14:39.190
Poe, what do you intend to do if I won't hand over Queen Dianna?

00:14:39.190 --> 00:14:42.980
Even before I was given these two Muttowoos, I intended to take her back by force, if necessary!

00:14:42.980 --> 00:14:44.110
Cover me!

00:14:45.190 --> 00:14:47.780
Militia soldier, take good care of Queen Dianna!

00:14:47.780 --> 00:14:49.110
Let's get back!

00:14:49.110 --> 00:14:50.780
Stop right there, Poe!

00:14:50.780 --> 00:14:53.700
You will hand that woman over to us, Harry!

00:14:53.700 --> 00:14:55.580
She referred to her as "woman"...

00:14:55.580 --> 00:14:58.200
Does that mean she's Lady Kihel?

00:14:59.500 --> 00:15:06.300
Lieutenant Poe has come after me. Then, the people on the Soleil genuinely believed that I'm Dianna!

00:15:09.300 --> 00:15:12.890
Even if you're using that skirt, you won't be able to defeat me!

00:15:12.890 --> 00:15:16.180
I don't want to fight! I'm only after that woman!

00:15:16.180 --> 00:15:17.020
Muttowoos!

00:15:19.680 --> 00:15:20.890
You tired old relic...!

00:15:24.900 --> 00:15:27.400
With or without a skirt, I'll still defeat you!

00:15:29.900 --> 00:15:31.200
That's too tight!

00:15:31.200 --> 00:15:32.410
Sir Guin!

00:15:32.410 --> 00:15:33.780
Loosen your grip on her!

00:15:33.780 --> 00:15:35.580
Understood, I'll do so now!

00:15:35.580 --> 00:15:38.080
We will take Dianna Soriel aboard the ship.

00:15:38.080 --> 00:15:43.080
From the looks of it, Dianna Counters wants both Dianna and Kihel.

00:15:43.380 --> 00:15:45.090
Dianna and Kihel...

00:15:45.090 --> 00:15:49.090
...how can we know which is which? Do they have some plan?

00:15:49.800 --> 00:15:51.720
No, in this case, what could their plan be?

00:15:52.510 --> 00:15:53.890
Guin Rhineford...

00:15:53.890 --> 00:15:56.300
Please don't attempt to go into space!

00:15:56.300 --> 00:15:57.810
That's another matter.

00:16:00.890 --> 00:16:04.900
Jalopy team, focus on attacking the other SUMO and its two backup mobile suits!

00:16:05.110 --> 00:16:07.820
For now, the Gold type is an ally!

00:16:09.110 --> 00:16:12.490
Roger that, We'll handle that SUMO. You attack the other two units.

00:16:12.490 --> 00:16:13.780
Got it, Miashei?

00:16:17.580 --> 00:16:20.500
There's another SUMO out here? What is it doing?

00:16:20.500 --> 00:16:23.790
The computer doesn't seem to have any data on those other two units!

00:16:23.790 --> 00:16:25.080
What's going on?

00:16:28.090 --> 00:16:29.300
Don't underestimate me!

00:16:32.380 --> 00:16:33.380
Shoot!

00:16:40.310 --> 00:16:42.480
Whether you're Dianna or Kihel, just stay put!

00:16:42.480 --> 00:16:45.400
How rude!

00:16:45.400 --> 00:16:47.480
Men with Bazookas, reform our front line.

00:16:47.900 --> 00:16:50.110
Lieutenant Poe?

00:16:50.780 --> 00:16:52.280
Hand that woman over to me!

00:16:52.280 --> 00:16:53.700
You want her back?

00:16:53.700 --> 00:16:55.910
If you come any closer, I'll kill her.

00:16:55.910 --> 00:16:58.780
How could you do something like that, you barbarian!?

00:16:58.780 --> 00:17:03.410
Aren't you the primitive people who use your mechanical dolls to preemptively kill and plunder?

00:17:03.410 --> 00:17:06.290
Why isn't Queen Dianna showing any sign of panic?

00:17:08.790 --> 00:17:11.590
All forces standing before Her Majesty, Salute!

00:17:17.390 --> 00:17:20.310
Before any of us had landed on earth...

00:17:20.310 --> 00:17:23.390
...my own undying loyalty had only been given to Queen Dianna Soriel.

00:17:24.180 --> 00:17:26.390
Listen to me, Poe...

00:17:26.390 --> 00:17:29.980
I will soon be in charge of everything within Dianna Counter.

00:17:29.980 --> 00:17:33.990
Then at that point, Poe, I'll make you the Queen of our kingdom!

00:17:33.990 --> 00:17:36.400
For this land that our ancestors once held...

00:17:36.400 --> 00:17:38.910
...let us return to our mother planet, The Earth!

00:17:38.910 --> 00:17:43.580
If I am the only one who becomes ruler, it does not matter if that woman lives or dies!

00:17:46.710 --> 00:17:50.090
I'll destroy everything that I can see!

00:17:50.090 --> 00:17:51.800
You'll kill your own Queen!

00:17:52.300 --> 00:17:53.510
Harry and another?

00:17:56.800 --> 00:17:58.010
All of you...!

00:18:00.010 --> 00:18:01.300
The White Doll?

00:18:01.300 --> 00:18:02.310
Loran!

00:18:03.600 --> 00:18:06.980
How can a member of the Royal Guard attack Queen Dianna!?

00:18:06.980 --> 00:18:07.980
It's the Mustache!

00:18:08.390 --> 00:18:11.820
That Silver-Type currently belongs to Dianna Counter!

00:18:11.820 --> 00:18:14.480
This operation was carried out without the Royal Guard's knowledge!

00:18:14.480 --> 00:18:17.490
That Silver-Type isn't from the Royal Guard?

00:18:17.490 --> 00:18:19.410
Lieutenant Poe, retreat!

00:18:19.410 --> 00:18:22.200
You won't have any chance at beating both the Mustache and myself!

00:18:22.200 --> 00:18:24.200
Do not attempt to take away Queen Dianna.

00:18:24.580 --> 00:18:27.290
Lieutenant Poe, Call off the Muttowoos!

00:18:27.290 --> 00:18:31.210
Please stop the fighting and take the time to reach a peaceful solution!

00:18:31.210 --> 00:18:35.000
Woman, stop spouting lies like Dianna Soriel did!

00:18:35.000 --> 00:18:37.380
You dare treat Queen Dianna with such disrespect?

00:18:37.380 --> 00:18:38.590
Harry...

00:18:39.180 --> 00:18:41.300
Chief Horace, can you get us away from here?

00:18:41.300 --> 00:18:44.390
Even if we were to take off, we'd still be targets.

00:18:44.390 --> 00:18:48.390
I'll try to get our main cannons and vulcans ready to use.

00:18:48.390 --> 00:18:50.310
Can we use the vulcans on the right side?

00:18:50.310 --> 00:18:51.400
Okay!

00:18:53.480 --> 00:18:55.610
Muttowoo, attack the enemy's spacecraft!

00:18:57.990 --> 00:18:59.400
I can't fire rapidly!

00:19:00.700 --> 00:19:01.990
Am I out of ammunition?

00:19:11.500 --> 00:19:13.710
Loran, I'll need you to go and back up the Jalopy team!

00:19:13.710 --> 00:19:15.590
We're going to use the Mega Particle Cannon!

00:19:15.590 --> 00:19:18.090
Mega Particle Cannon? On the Willgem?

00:19:19.510 --> 00:19:22.300
The Mustached mechanical doll?

00:19:24.300 --> 00:19:26.600
Can mechanical dolls actually fly into the sky?

00:19:26.600 --> 00:19:27.680
It's more like a long jump.

00:19:38.690 --> 00:19:39.900
The mechanical doll...

00:19:39.900 --> 00:19:41.110
It exploded!

00:19:42.700 --> 00:19:45.120
That explosion was... A mobile suit?

00:19:47.700 --> 00:19:49.000
The Muttowoo was destroyed?

00:19:49.410 --> 00:19:50.410
Lieutenant Poe...

00:19:51.790 --> 00:19:55.000
Lieutenant Poe, I'll shoot you down now if you don't leave!

00:19:57.590 --> 00:20:00.220
That odd Machine that came here with the SUMO...

00:20:00.220 --> 00:20:01.720
What was it?

00:20:01.720 --> 00:20:04.300
It's a Mobile Armor type Mobile Suit.

00:20:04.300 --> 00:20:08.810
It was uncovered from Lost Mountain by Lieutenant Zenoa.

00:20:08.810 --> 00:20:13.190
Lieutenant Zenoa... that same Mr. Zenoa?

00:20:20.400 --> 00:20:24.110
Great work! We can use the Mega Particle Cannon!

00:20:24.110 --> 00:20:25.410
That's some amazing technology.

00:20:26.280 --> 00:20:29.580
That shot came from some of their own.

00:20:29.580 --> 00:20:33.500
I believe that we can trust those Moonrace technicians now.

00:20:33.500 --> 00:20:39.090
Roger that. It looks like studying ancient technology is the only thing they care about now.

00:20:39.090 --> 00:20:40.510
That's exactly it.

00:20:40.510 --> 00:20:44.510
Still, Do you believe that there may be any Mountain Cycles on the moon?

00:20:44.510 --> 00:20:46.510
Think you might lose sleep over it?

00:20:46.510 --> 00:20:48.100
What do you think, Sir?

00:20:48.100 --> 00:20:49.390
There's nothing we can do.

00:20:49.390 --> 00:20:54.810
In only a few short months, they learned how to use a piece of technology it took mankind millennia to design.

00:20:54.810 --> 00:20:58.820
In short, we should be ready for anything that could happen, right?

00:20:59.110 --> 00:21:01.990
It's all too big for me.

00:21:01.990 --> 00:21:04.700
I'm getting pretty excited about it now!

00:21:04.700 --> 00:21:07.410
Humans can just be so amazing at times...

00:21:07.410 --> 00:21:09.200
Right, Sir Guin?

00:21:14.790 --> 00:21:18.790
Having such powerful weapons can only cause people to make mistakes...

00:21:18.790 --> 00:21:22.510
But, they're also tools which can be used to protect others.

00:21:22.510 --> 00:21:26.510
That may be so, but it still doesn't change the source of their evil.

00:21:26.510 --> 00:21:28.010
I suppose so.

00:21:28.010 --> 00:21:30.890
If Miss Kihel were here right now, I'm sure she would say the same thing.

00:21:30.890 --> 00:21:32.890
- If Miss Kihel were?
- Yes.

00:21:34.180 --> 00:21:36.310
Is she currently locked away in the Soriel?

00:21:36.310 --> 00:21:37.480
Probably.

00:21:37.980 --> 00:21:40.820
Queen Dianna and Milady Kihel...

00:21:40.820 --> 00:21:44.490
If I have to, perhaps I could go there with Lieutenant Harry to rescue her!

00:21:44.490 --> 00:21:45.780
I'll leave that to you.

00:21:47.200 --> 00:21:49.280
Lady Kihel Heim...

00:21:49.280 --> 00:21:51.280
...please leave this place.

00:21:51.280 --> 00:21:52.290
I can leave?

00:21:52.290 --> 00:21:56.080
Yes. There are still those who still believe you to be our Queen.

00:21:56.910 --> 00:21:59.500
Currently, Ambassador Miran is waiting for you outside.

00:21:59.500 --> 00:22:01.790
Ambassador Miran?

00:22:02.210 --> 00:22:05.380
Does Commander Phil know anything about this?

00:22:05.380 --> 00:22:06.800
No, he doesn't.

00:22:06.800 --> 00:22:08.010
Is that so?

00:22:08.010 --> 00:22:11.010
We will all be waiting in anticipation of your return.

00:22:11.010 --> 00:22:12.390
Thank you...

00:22:12.390 --> 00:22:15.390
But, would this be acceptable if I were actually Kihel Heim?

00:22:15.390 --> 00:22:18.810
Two are one, and the one...

00:22:18.810 --> 00:22:20.610
...is also two.

00:22:20.610 --> 00:22:21.690
Yes.

00:22:22.190 --> 00:22:23.690
Thank you.

00:22:28.530 --> 00:22:34.540
<b><i>Binetsu ga samenai mama</i></b>

00:22:28.530 --> 00:22:34.540
<b>As if unawoken from a slight fever</b>

00:22:34.540 --> 00:22:40.790
<b><i>Utsumuku shounen no hitomi wa</i></b>

00:22:34.540 --> 00:22:40.790
<b>The eyes of the boy hanging his head</b>

00:22:40.790 --> 00:22:46.510
<b><i>Kokoro no umi mitsumete</i></b>

00:22:40.790 --> 00:22:46.510
<b>Gaze upon the sea of his heart</b>

00:22:46.510 --> 00:22:50.510
<b><i>Shizuka ni hohoenderu</i></b>

00:22:46.510 --> 00:22:50.510
<b>And smile silently</b>

00:22:52.220 --> 00:22:57.020
<b><i>Umare kuru mono kiete yuku mono</i></b>

00:22:52.220 --> 00:22:57.020
<b>What is born, and what fades away</b>

00:22:57.020 --> 00:23:03.230
<b><i>Subete wa sadame no furiko no haba</i></b>

00:22:57.020 --> 00:23:03.230
<b>Are but the sway of the pendulum of fate</b>

00:23:03.230 --> 00:23:08.950
<b><i>Zasetsu no yami o tsukinuke mietekuru</i></b>

00:23:03.230 --> 00:23:08.950
<b>Piercing the darkness of frustration, he begins to see it</b>

00:23:08.950 --> 00:23:14.530
<b><i>Sore ga hikari no shinjitsu</i></b>

00:23:08.950 --> 00:23:14.530
<b>It is the reality of the light</b>

00:23:14.530 --> 00:23:16.870
<b><i>Aura</i></b>

00:23:14.530 --> 00:23:16.870
<b>Aura</b>

00:23:16.870 --> 00:23:25.340
<b><i>Yoake totomoni wasuresareru hoshi ni sasagu</i></b>

00:23:16.870 --> 00:23:25.340
<b>Together with dawn, he gives an offering to the stars that will be forgotten</b>

00:23:25.340 --> 00:23:27.630
<b><i>Aura</i></b>

00:23:25.340 --> 00:23:27.630
<b>Aura</b>

00:23:27.630 --> 00:23:35.510
<b><i>Shijou no ai wa chiisana sono te no naka ni aru</i></b>

00:23:27.630 --> 00:23:35.510
<b>History's love lies in his tiny hands</b>

00:23:40.100 --> 00:23:44.230
<i>It pains me to see Milady Sochie wearing her wedding dress.</i>

00:23:45.020 --> 00:23:47.730
<i>But, before I had the time to explore the feelings of my heart...</i>

00:23:48.280 --> 00:23:49.490
<i>I once again deploy to battle.</i>

00:23:50.990 --> 00:23:55.740
<i>The Red Team now believes Milady Kihel is their true Queen Dianna.</i>

00:23:58.790 --> 00:24:03.330
<i>Next time... on </i>TURN A GUNDAM... 
"Holding It In The Chest"

00:24:03.330 --> 00:24:06.380
"The wind forms a water spout."

00:24:03.540 --> 00:24:08.420
<b>Holding It In The Chest</b>
